# Must register after the uniform-location lifecycle transformer: the
# deferred error check consumes the composed method shapes uniform produces
# on shader/A (or shader/y) and SGFramework/g, and its frame-end query rides
# the lifecycle bridge's render scope. Retransformation replays the chain in
# registration order, so this transform observes the uniform output; closing
# runs in reverse so the uniform restoration baseline stays intact.
dev.turboism.bootstrap.DeferredGlErrorCheckHookContributor
# Must register after the uniform-location cache: the lifecycle transformer
